WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.800
“Thermal here, turn right.”

2
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.500
“Open up.”

3
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.000
“Centred, hold it.”

4
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.300
“Climbing 2.0.”

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.000
“100 metres.”

6
00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.000
“90.”

7
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.150
“40.”

8
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.400
“Valley turnpoint reached.”

9
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.400
“Next: Goal, 1.7 kilometres, at 12 o'clock.”

10
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.600
“Goal reached.”

11
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:43.600
“Route complete. Well done.”
